@startuml
' Closing a meter: nothing is deleted until the contract account is gone.
' Source for public/assets/img/two-orderings-close-*.png.
!include style.iuml
$lifelines()

B -> C : close and revoke\n(the reader's wallet sends it)
B -> S : POST the close's signature
S -> C : poll the signature, up to 20 s

alt landed and failed
  S --> B : nothing was deleted
else confirmed, or no answer in 20 s
  S -> C : read the contract account
  alt account gone
    S -> D : delete sessions, grants, lock row
    S --> B : receipt: what was deleted
  else account still there
    S -> D : note: a close is pending
    S --> B : reload in a moment
  end
end

note over S, C
  The signature only says when to look.
  The missing account is the proof.
end note
@enduml
